    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48246" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Thūlē</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Thȳlē</span></b> ),
			ēs, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θούλη</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θύλη,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an island in the
				extreme nortl of Europe;</i> acc. to some, <i>Iceland;</i> acc. to others, <i>Mainland</i>
			(the largest of the Shetland lslands), <i><span class="en">Mel. 3, 6,
			9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 2, 75, 77, § 187</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 16, 30, §
